#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:313
msgid ""
"Marker is similar to `Alpha Darken`_, but adheres to alpha lock/inherit "
"alpha and interpolates between colors cleanly. It's most useful when you use "
"it on a brush in \"Build-Up\" mode painting mode, wheere it will only "
"increase the opacity on your layer if the opacity of your stroke is higher "
"and mixes the colors, like the marker tool in Paint Tool SAI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:317
msgid ""
"It's also conceptually similar to `Greater`_, which in turn only mixes the "
"colors if your stroke's opacity is higher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:319
msgid ""
"The Opacity and Flow behavior is identical to `Alpha Darken`_, they only "
"affect the blending of the **alpha** channel, but the **color** channels are "
"blended as if they were set to 100%."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:322
msgid "Normal (Blending Mode)"
